{ Hey welcome to another one of MPEN480's studies!!!
This time we'll be learning about how to crush with the Queen attack!!!
play d4 }
1. d4 { Now people of the Kurtz might already seen this move where we played 2. e3 before 2. c4 } 1... d5 { Now instead of using the e3 move, play c4!! } 2. c4 { BONKING THE CENTER!!!!!!!
People decline the Queen's gambit more often } 2... e6 { Yes
Now make a nice developing move! } { [%csl Gf3][%cal Gg1f3] } 3. Nf3 { Yessir } 3... dxc4 $40 { Now this is the third most common move, instead of e4 or e3 or Nc3 just that type of thingy, play Qa4+!!!! } 4. Qa4+!? $132 $146 { This is the new Queen attack, it attacks the pawn and if plays Nc6 they cannot recover the advantage cause the knight is defending the pawn, soo.....
The main point is to recapture the pawn quickly!! } *


