[ChapterMode "gamebook"]

4... Bd7 5. Qxc4 Nc6 6. Nc3 { So we saw what to do if Black plays 6. Nf6, but what if they pin our knight? } 6... Bb4 { No comment, just kick that bishop out } 7. a3 Bxc3+ 8. Qxc3 Nf6 { We'll play e3 to free the bishop to play e4 next, develop our other bishop, launch a queenside attack and castle } { [%csl Ge3,Gd3,Gd2,Ge4,Gb4][%cal Ge2e3,Gf1d3,Gc1d2,Ge1h1,Ge1a1,Ge3e4,Gb2b4] } *


