{ Now, what if Black plays Nc6? }
4... Nc6 { This is the Knight's defence, no comment, just take the pawn } 5. Qxc4 Nf6 { [%csl Gc3][%cal Gb1c3] } 6. Nc3 { And now it's basically a Bishop's defence Main line position but without the bishop on d2 } *


