{ But what if Black plays the move Nd7? }
4... Nd7! { This line is surprisingly strong against Qxc4 but since the knight is pinned and there is no knight on f6 yet, play e4! } 5. e4 { Now our win rate got back to a 49% } 5... Nf6 { They try to develop but the knight is pinned and it will take more time for them to pin our knight so Nc3 } 6. Nc3 $10 { And we have a surprisingly good structure while Black can have their pawn so Stockfish says equal but the win rate for white is 50% compared to 42% of black } *


